v0.091: send DPD delivery notification email/mobile and add extended liability toggle

Fixes "Delivery notification email or mobile is mandatory" rejection by
populating outboundConsignment.deliveryDetails.notificationDetails - a
field separate from contactDetails.telephone (the courier-facing contact
number), used by DPD to text/email the recipient about their delivery.
Since the system only ever captures one phone number and one email per
order, both are reused for the notification fields.

Adds an "extended liability" checkbox to Settings > DPD, off by default,
since it's a chargeable DPD insurance option. When enabled, sends the
order's own goods value (capped at DPD's £5,000 maximum) as liabilityValue.

